{"id":"reja","lemma":"reja","pos":"noun","rank":4364,"glosses":["grate, grating, grille","bars (especially of a prison cell)"],"ipa":"/ˈrexa/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"rejas"},"order":4365,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/10/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-reja.wav","examples":[{"text":"No estoy aquí para ponerte entre rejas.","en":"I'm not here to arrest you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611994","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"here"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"to put, to place","l":"poner"},{"g":"between"},null]},{"text":"Nuestra reja es de hierro.","en":"Our fence is made of iron.","words":[{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"strong"]]},{"text":"Él ha pasado diez años entre rejas por asesinato.","en":"He has spent ten years in jail for murder.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/692551","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"past"},{"g":"A"},{"g":"year","l":"año"},{"g":"between"},null,{"g":"for / by"},{"g":"assassination"}]}]}